## 1) Important: Stage1 “fixed flexible” → Stage2 movable hours/OT

You asked:

> phase 1 flexible was fixed and unfinished in phase 2 … total hour/overtime should count again before phase 2

✅ Your current code already does that correctly **IF** you only exclude `pinnedFixed` (true fixed) from “dynamic” totals.

But right now, some constraints exclude both `pinnedFixed || warmPinned`:

```java
if (s.pinnedFixed || s.warmPinned) return 0;
```

That’s OK in stage1, **but in stage2 you set `warmPinned=false`**, so the seat starts counting again automatically.

So the “count again” part is fine — the performance part is what needs refactor.

