## 2) BIG WIN: Remove DaySlot join from these constraints

These are currently expensive:

* `annualOvertimeLimit`
* `monthlyOvertimeLimit`
* `softBalanceTotalHours`

They all do: `forEach(DaySlot).join(CrewSeat).join(BlockDecision).filter(seatCoversDay...)`

Replace with **seat interval contribution**:

### Add these helpers (near other helpers)

```java
static Integer seatStart(CrewSeat s, BlockDecision b) {
    boolean pinned = s.isPinned();
    return pinned ? s.pinnedStart : (b == null ? null : b.startDay);
}
static Integer seatDays(CrewSeat s, BlockDecision b) {
    boolean pinned = s.isPinned();
    return pinned ? s.pinnedDays : (b == null ? null : b.days);
}

// Count WORKING days for this seat-span (fab closures respected via isWorkingDay)
static int seatWorkingDays(CrewSeat s, BlockDecision b) {
    Integer st = seatStart(s, b);
    Integer dy = seatDays(s, b);
    if (st == null || dy == null || dy <= 0) return 0;
    return workingDaysCount(st, dy, s.factory);
}

// Total hours contributed by this seat in its span
static int seatTotalHours(CrewSeat s, BlockDecision b) {
    if (b == null) return 0;
    if (s.pinnedFixed) return 0; // fixed schedule already in FIXED_TOTAL_HOURS_BY_EMP
    int wd = seatWorkingDays(s, b);
    return wd * b.chosenHours();
}

// Total overtime hours contributed by this seat in its span (simple, not split by month/year)
static int seatTotalOvertime(CrewSeat s, BlockDecision b) {
    if (b == null) return 0;
    if (s.pinnedFixed) return 0;
    int otPerDay = Math.max(0, b.chosenHours() - SinglePassConstraints.BASE_HOURS_PER_DAY);
    int wd = seatWorkingDays(s, b);
    return wd * otPerDay;
}
```

### Replace `softBalanceTotalHours` with interval version

```java
Constraint softBalanceTotalHours(ConstraintFactory f) {
    return f.forEach(CrewSeat.class)
        .join(f.forEach(BlockDecision.class),
            Joiners.equal((CrewSeat s) -> s.blockId, (BlockDecision b) -> b.id))
        .filter((s, b) -> !isUnassigned(s.employee))
        .groupBy((s, b) -> s.employee.id,
                 ConstraintCollectors.sum((s, b) -> seatTotalHours(s, b)))
        .penalize(HardMediumSoftScore.ONE_SOFT, (empId, dynTot) -> {
            int fixedTot = FIXED_TOTAL_HOURS_BY_EMP.getOrDefault(empId, 0);
            int total = dynTot + fixedTot;
            return (int) Math.abs(total - TARGET_HOURS_PER_EMP);
        })
        .asConstraint("soft-balance-total-hours");
}
```

✅ This removes `DaySlot` entirely from total-hours balancing.

