## 3) OT split by month/year without DaySlot×Seat explosion

For OT limits you **must split by year/month** (because a block span can cross boundaries).
But you still don’t need `forEach(DaySlot)` globally — do the day-walk **only per seat span**.

### Add a helper that computes OT per Year/Month for one seat

```java
static void addSeatOtByYm(
    Map<Integer, Integer> ymToOt,
    CrewSeat s, BlockDecision b,
    LocalDate planStart
) {
    if (b == null) return;
    if (s.pinnedFixed) return;

    Integer st = seatStart(s, b);
    Integer dy = seatDays(s, b);
    if (st == null || dy == null || dy <= 0) return;

    int otPerDay = Math.max(0, b.chosenHours() - SinglePassConstraints.BASE_HOURS_PER_DAY);
    if (otPerDay == 0) return;

    int end = st + dy - 1;
    for (int dayId = st; dayId <= end; dayId++) {
        if (!isWorkingDay(dayId, s.factory)) continue;
        LocalDate d = planStart.plusDays(dayId);
        int ym = d.getYear() * 100 + d.getMonthValue();
        ymToOt.merge(ym, otPerDay, Integer::sum);
    }
}
```

