## 5) Micro fix: clamp pinned fixed span to active day range

Even with trimmed DaySlots, you can reduce work by clamping fixed spans so they don’t cover huge ranges:

In pinned-seat build:

```java
int minActiveDay = sch.daySlots.stream().mapToInt(d -> d.id).min().orElse(0);

int minDid = fa.hoursByDay.keySet().stream().min(Integer::compareTo).orElse(minActiveDay);
int maxDid = fa.hoursByDay.keySet().stream().max(Integer::compareTo).orElse(minDid);

// clamp to active range
minDid = Math.max(minDid, minActiveDay);
maxDid = Math.max(maxDid, minDid);

cs.pinnedStart = minDid;
cs.pinnedDays  = Math.max(1, maxDid - minDid + 1);
```

This keeps fixed seats from “stretching” into irrelevant past.

